section: base
synopsis: Add strict variants to mutable types (IORef, Chan, MVar)
issues: #27343
mrs: !15450

description: {
	These new types prevent users from (easily) mis-using existing and dangerous APIs (writeIORef, modifyIORef, modifyMVar, etc) which can lead to space leaks when stored in mutable containers.
	They also prevent invisible coercions to and from their lazy equivalents by not exposing their constructors.
}
